# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says, so a file a command writes
# is the same on every machine that writes it (until 28 October 2026 a CRLF checkout built a committed dist that CI's
# Linux build did not). The byte-for-byte folders below opt out; a later line wins.
* text=auto eol=lf

# MapLibre's worker, vendored byte for byte (maplibre-worker-vendored.test.mjs compares it with the package): no line-ending conversion.
apps/dashboard/public/maplibre/* -text

# Generated files, rewritten by their commands and never edited by hand: GitHub folds them in a pull request's diff (one
# click opens them), so a review reads the change and not what a command wrote from it.
**/*.generated.* linguist-generated=true
packages/db/src/database.types.ts linguist-generated=true
supabase/schema.sql linguist-generated=true
docs/data-model.md linguist-generated=true
docs/api.md linguist-generated=true
# The agent client's audio worklets, vendored byte for byte (voice-worklets.test.mjs compares them with the package): no line-ending conversion.
apps/dashboard/public/voice/* -text
